category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "C library and command line tools for LZMA compression and decompression (utilities)"
ldesc: "Easylzma is a C library and command line tools for LZMA compression and
decompression. It uses a Igor Pavlov's reference implementation and SDK
written in C."
